<p>Thank you for your interest in Project Implicit.</p>

<p>Based on the information provided, you are not eligible to participate in this study.</p>

<p>In order to participate in a Project Implicit study, you must be 18 years of age or older. To learn about implicit biases, please <a href='https://www.projectimplicit.net/resources/about-the-iat/'>visit this page instead.</a></p>

<p>We are in the process of developing new opportunities for people under 18 years of age. Please check back for updates!</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please contact <a href = "mailto: questions@projectimplicit.net">questions@projectimplicit.net</a>.</p>

